 WritePage object
⍝ Flush the Bitmap to the Printer page & empty it
⍝ If the Bitmap hasn't ever been used then do nothing; otherwise make sure the image is transferred to paper

 :If ~object ##.dirty ⍬ ⋄ :Return ⋄ :EndIf ⍝ If nothing was ever written, then don't flush to the printer page

 ⍝ Time to transfer the Bitmap content to the page for printing
 (object⍕⍛,'.')##.##.##.∆WC'Image'('Coord' 'RealPixel')('Points' 0 0)('Picture' object._pic)

 EmptyPage object ⍝ Reset the Bitmap back to pure White
